WEBVTT

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:07.110
Yui! Good morning!

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.740
Good morning!

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:11.710
Oh? Your hair is so smooth!

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:14.770
Wow, you're right! How nice!

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.400
I had time yesterday, so I got a treatment.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.340
Oh, Hiyama! Good morning!

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:26.830
H-H-Hiyama! G-G-G-Good m-m-morning! Yo-yo-yo!

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:30.040
What? Yui, are you a DJ?

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:33.850
O-O-Oh! Aoi! Good morning, yo!

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.480
What's going on?

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:40.510
You two are acting weird!

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:44.690
Don't tell me you two have started going out?

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:48.780
I knew it!

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:53.760
Yes... Starting from yesterday, actually.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:00:57.920
Congratulations!

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:03.020
Extra! Extra!

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:06.150
Class 6-2 has a second couple!

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:09.400
Another couple!

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:19.800
Aoi Yui, age 12.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:22.070
I have a boyfriend now.

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:26.020
But I feel kind of down.

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:15.130
Which one is Hiyama's girlfriend?

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.790
She's not here.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:18.010
I heard her name is Aoi.

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.130
I wonder who it is?

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:21.560
I can't accept it if she's ugly.

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:24.230
I've always liked Hiyama, you know.

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:35.100
Hiyama sure is popular.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:37.040
Yui!

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.700
So you were here.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.840
Huh? You seem down.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:47.670
I finally became his girlfriend,

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:49.940
but I can't even see him.

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:52.580
I can't even talk to him normally.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:56.390
I don't know what I should do.

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:01.110
You can't talk about this with your parents either.

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:03.100
If you want to get closer...

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:05.690
Yui! Let's go on a date together!

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:10.070
I'm going on a date with Takao soon!

00:04:10.070 --> 00:04:13.970
Why don't you two join us?

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:16.050
To celebrate this occasion!

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:19.530
Double date, eh?

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:21.360
Double date?

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:21.990
What is that?

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:28.230
A double date is when two couples go on a date together!

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:31.590
It's not so nervous with your friends around.

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:36.010
You may naturally develop romantic feelings, too!

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:38.300
R-Really?

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.150
How about it, Yui?

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:45.320
Okay! Let's go on a double date, Hanabi.

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:48.730
Let me go ask Takao!

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:53.940
I should ask Hiyama, too!

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:55.250
That was interesting.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:57.120
Yeah, it was!

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:58.030
It was hilarious!

00:04:58.030 --> 00:04:58.550
Yeah!

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:02.890
Ayase.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:05.000
Takao!

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:08.570
What's up?

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:12.870
Um, about the date...

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.000
Yeah?

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:19.980
I want it to be a double date with Yui and Hiyama!

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:21.130
Is that okay?

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:23.560
Double date?

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:24.840
Yes, yes!

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:28.160
Yui said she hasn't talked to Hiyama a lot lately...

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:32.980
She was sighing and looking all down, like this.

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:37.510
So the two of them want to be more like a couple?

00:05:37.510 --> 00:05:40.130
Yes, yes! That's it!

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:41.040
So please...

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:42.490
Sure!

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:45.600
Thank you!

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:48.730
What did you want to talk about?

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:51.120
U-Um...

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:57.540
If it's all right with you...

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:00.510
Would you like to go out sometime?

00:06:01.890 --> 00:06:04.180
You mean by ourselves?

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:10.660
A double date with Hanabi and Takao...

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:11.450
Eh!?

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:22.650
I'm sorry.

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:25.130
It's okay if you don't want to go.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:26.860
I'll go.

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:43.450
In order to make this the greatest double date ever,

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:47.400
your clothes and hairstyle must feel different!

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.880
Feel different?

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:54.090
B-But going all out sounds embarrassing.

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:57.410
When are you gonna go all out then!?

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:00.630
It's your first date, right?

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:04.560
Make yourselves cuter and have the boys' hearts throb!

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:05.730
Okay!

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.390
I said feel different,

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:10.610
but all I really meant was to add some hair accessories.

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:14.400
The key part is cute accessories!

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:19.170
Then some lipstick to make your lips fuller.

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:21.600
And hand cream to make your hands all smooth.

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:22.680
Lips?

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:23.540
Hands?

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:25.200
Why?

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:30.790
Dates start with a heartpounding encounter and holding hands!

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:32.840
And it ends with a kiss!

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:37.960
T-That's too much...!

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:40.740
You have to go right for the kill!

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:41.750
That's what my sister said.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:46.000
My heart is beating so fast right now.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.360
Yeah...

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:51.260
But you two have the look of young maidens in love!

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:52.990
That's really cute!

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:58.860
Our first date as couples.

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:00.360
I can't wait!

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:11.740
They're so slow.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:15.810
Aoi didn't look like the type of person to be late.

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:18.240
I'm sorry we're late!

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.060
So slow!

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:26.000
It took a bit of time to prepare!

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.380
You look really cute.

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:49.160
H-Hiyama, um...

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:51.640
Is something weird?

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:55.660
No... It's just that you look different from usual.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:59.070
I was just surprised and it felt kinda weird.

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:00.730
So it is weird!?

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:02.070
No...

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:04.780
You look nice.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:11.040
What should we do? What should we do?

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:14.310
I can't wait! There's so much I want to do!

00:09:14.310 --> 00:09:20.510
Yeah! But my dad told me not to stay out too late.

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:22.710
I see. You're right.

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:24.460
We have to plan this out.

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.340
This hat is so cute!

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.530
It looks good on you.

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:36.800
Me, too.

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:39.120
Is this cute, Hiyama?

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:44.380
Not really...

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:45.450
Eh?

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:48.750
But I guess after looking at it for a while, it may work.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.500
Maybe you've always had that face?

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:53.680
I don't!

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:04.800
So scary!

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:16.350
It's Rabbit Panda!

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:18.130
I want it!

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:21.280
But I've never played a crane game before.

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:22.990
But I want it!

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:27.710
You love Rabbit Panda, right?

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:30.910
Oh, you can't get it from that position.

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:37.880
You're aiming for the Rabbit Panda?

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:40.620
Would you like me to move them around so it's easier to get?

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:42.600
Can you do that?

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:43.890
Wait, Ayase.

00:10:53.490 --> 00:10:54.870
Looking good!

00:10:54.870 --> 00:10:56.560
Go for it, Takao!

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:01.330
Wow, wow! You're amazing, Takao! Go!

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:05.230
Yes!

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:10.860
Here you go, Ayase.

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:15.510
Your boyfriend is so cool.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:19.750
Can I really have this?

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:21.080
Of course.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:24.400
It's to celebrate you cheering me on.

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:28.110
Thank you, Takao!

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:33.700
That's great, Hanabi.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:36.600
How about you, Aoi?

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:37.600
Huh?

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:39.240
Anything you want to do?

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:43.310
I-I do!

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:49.060
Girls really do love photo sticker booths.

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:50.060
Yep!

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:52.820
It's been my dream to take photos with my boyfriend!

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:57.520
Please choose your desired brightness.

00:11:58.380 --> 00:11:59.130
Huh?

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:01.890
What kind of pose should I do?

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:04.580
Hey! Aren't you supposed to be used to this?

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:08.670
I feel so n-n-nervous...

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:11.220
I'm sorry! This isn't going well.

00:12:11.220 --> 00:12:12.110
Let's just go.

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:13.740
Just look in the front for now.

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:18.210
Wasn't it your dream to take a photo together?

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:30.810
Try kissing each other on the cheek next!

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:33.100
Impossible!

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:47.310
Oh no, there's a ghost in my photo.

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:48.450
Actually, it's Aoi.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.740
Stop it! Stop teasing me!

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:52.640
I look so awkward, too.

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:55.720
It may be an awkward photo,

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:59.720
but I feel like this is just like us.

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:06.240
Hey, why don't we go somewhere next time...

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:09.230
Hiyama, let's go back to Hanabi and Takao.

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:32.980
Here. So we don't get separated.

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:35.440
Okay. I'm sorry.

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:46.240
They held hands so naturally.

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:48.460
How nice, Hanabi.

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:50.260
I want to hold Hiyama's hands, too.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.910
Found our couples!

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:02.270
Scoop! Scoop!

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.120
Give us a few words!

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:06.640
Scoop!

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:08.190
A comment, please!

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:12.180
Eikou and his friends! Why are they here?

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:13.120
Hiyama.

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:16.230
Ayase.

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:17.370
We're running away, Aoi.

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:18.450
Okay.

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:21.180
They separated!?

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:23.310
Let's do formation B, guys!

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:24.080
Okay!

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:52.200
Seems like we've finally lost them.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.230
Oh, there they are.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.280
Yui!

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:06.760
We found each other.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:07.960
Thank goodness.

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:12.490
It's great that we planned where to meet beforehand.

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:16.720
Jeez, we can't let them ruin our date.

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:20.460
It's gone!

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.630
It's gone!

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:25.880
My Rabbit Panda...

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:30.040
Did you drop it while we were running away?

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:32.030
What should I do?

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:36.800
That was the first present you gave me...

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:42.600
I'm sorry! I...

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:45.170
I...

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:47.340
Ayase.

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:53.630
For now, take a deep breath and calm down.

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:02.400
Here.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:07.960
We got ice cocoa for everyone. Is that all right?

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:08.890
Yep.

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:11.470
Oh, money for the drinks.

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:12.770
How much did it cost?

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:14.180
It's fine.

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:16.890
Ayase, enjoy your drink.

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:18.710
Thank you.

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:19.860
Thank you.

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.060
Delicious!

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:28.010
It's all right. We'll definitely find it.

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:31.240
I'll help you find it, too.

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:33.600
That's asking too much of you, Yui.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:36.010
You're on a date with Hiyama.

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:40.880
It's all thanks to this double date with you two that I get to be with Hiyama.

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:42.390
I had a lot of fun.

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:47.560
But I can't just ignore you like this.

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:50.780
Yui...

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:56.390
Don't worry about it. It'll be faster if we all look for it.

00:16:56.720 --> 00:16:59.590
Hiyama... Yui...

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:01.230
Thank you!

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:05.460
Then let's go back the way we came.

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:11.310
Rabbit Panda... Rabbit Panda... Rabbit Panda...

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:15.470
We passed by that stationery store before, right?

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:21.150
Yep! It was a very cute shop, so we stopped and had a peek inside!

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:25.590
Before that, we stopped at the general store, right?

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:28.770
Yes! They sold heart-shaped handkerchiefs!

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.640
We went all over the place.

00:17:30.640 --> 00:17:31.900
It just happened...

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:32.790
But I understand!

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:35.760
Cute things just pop up right in front of you.

00:17:37.060 --> 00:17:41.060
We went this way before the general store, right?

00:17:41.060 --> 00:17:47.160
Yes! Rabbit Panda! Rabbit Panda! Rabbit Panda!

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:47.930
Ayase.

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:50.720
Look underneath the chair.

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.510
There it is!

00:17:56.510 --> 00:18:00.280
I found it! I found it! My Rabbit Panda!

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:01.980
That's great.

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:04.930
Takao... Yep!

00:18:12.100 --> 00:18:14.180
Oh, it's 5 PM.

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:17.290
It's about time to go home.

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:22.670
Yui! Hiyama! Thank you for looking with me!

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:25.590
Let's go.

00:18:25.590 --> 00:18:26.410
Okay!

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:52.820
It was over just like that, but our first date was so much fun.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.170
We took our photos, too.

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:09.960
But I wanted to hold his hands...

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:16.710
It may just... end like this...

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:25.760
Hiyama?

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:28.030
The double date is over.

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:33.240
Aoi!

00:19:42.630 --> 00:19:45.510
I want to walk Aoi home by myself.

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:47.240
Okay!

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:50.000
What's going on?

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:52.450
They want to be alone, I guess.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:54.600
I see.

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:55.610
Me too.

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:59.490
Let me walk you home.

00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:02.550
Okay!

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:15.380
I'm sorry.

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:16.580
Huh?

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:20.410
I ended the double date like that.

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:22.720
I was happy.

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:24.830
I heard how you felt.

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:28.990
And we held hands.

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:49.670
U-Um... I want to stay with you a bit longer.

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:52.810
Stop saying such embarrassing things.

00:20:54.090 --> 00:20:55.680
You're making me blush.

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:03.020
Let's walk around a bit more.

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:21.860
I want to hold his hands again sometime.

00:23:04.740 --> 00:23:06.460
I see, I see!

00:23:06.460 --> 00:23:08.400
It was a wonderful first date, eh?

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:10.670
Yes!

00:23:10.670 --> 00:23:12.240
Out of my way, shorty.

00:23:17.050 --> 00:23:18.880
I think I've seen you before...

00:23:21.070 --> 00:23:22.060
Hanabi?

00:23:24.930 --> 00:23:26.470
Tsutsumi?

00:23:30.940 --> 00:23:33.980
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:23:33.980 --> 00:23:36.760
I met someone I didn't expect to see!

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:42.930
A transfer student from Tokyo?

00:23:42.930 --> 00:23:44.750
He seems to know Ayase.

00:23:44.750 --> 00:23:46.690
He's blonde and has a haughty attitude.

00:23:46.690 --> 00:23:48.730
Seems like someone amazing has arrived.

00:23:48.730 --> 00:23:52.490
He always teases Ayase, but don't tell me...
